source: crates/deft-cli/../../tests/unit/help.rs
expression: "help::group(g.name)"
---
deft slides - commands (input -> output)
  info     pptx -> report  Slide count, titles, images, notes
  from-md  md -> pptx      Make a deck: each heading or --- starts a slide [beta]
  to-md    pptx -> md      Outline in Markdown: a heading per slide, bullets, images
  to-pdf   pptx -> pdf     Handout PDF of slide content [beta]
  to-text  pptx -> txt     Extract the text of every slide, form feed between slides
More: deft slides <command> --help
